## Command

```shell
biome lint '<TEMP_DIR>/nested_config_rule_reads_tailwind_stylesheet'
```

## `app/biome.json`

```json
{
  "root": false,
  "extends": "//",
  "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./src/styles.css" },
  "linter": { "rules": { "nursery": { "useTailwindSortedClasses": "error" } } }
}
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "root": true }
```

